The learning agent can now play against both other bots and previous versions itself. Player roster can be updated in the roster.json file. 

To import a probabilistic bot (RandomBot, RiskyBot, RiskAverseBot) do the following:

{
  "RandomBot": 1
}

Increase the integer value for desired number of bots for that type.  

For multiple types of bots do the following:

{
  "RandomBot": 1,
  "RiskyBot": 1
}

For self play, add a DQNBot to the roster:

{
  "DQNBot": {"count": 1, "model":"check_1.pt"}
}

You will need a saved .pt model in order to load a DQNBot into the game.

IMPORTANT NOTE:
The sum of the players in the roster can be less than but must not exceed MAX_PLAYERS - 1 in config.py.

