OpenGL extension functions `glVertexAttribDivisor` and `glDrawArraysInstanced` were called directly instead of through `context.extensions`, breaking cross-platform compatibility.

### Changes

- Prefixed all `glVertexAttribDivisor` calls with `ext.` (lines 137, 145, 153, 161)
- Prefixed `glDrawArraysInstanced` call with `ext.` (line 327)

